title: Main
new-page: true

on-arrival: if (typeof Q.inflation !== 'number') Q.inflation = 65; if (typeof Q.public_support !== 'number') Q.public_support = 50; if (typeof Q.security !== 'number') Q.security = 45; if (typeof Q.stability !== 'number') Q.stability = 55; if (typeof Q.month !== 'number') Q.month = 12; if (typeof Q.year !== 'number') Q.year = 1969; if (typeof Q.party_name !== 'string') Q.party_name = 'Not selected';

ITALY, DECEMBER 1969

The Italian Republic is entering a period of profound political crisis. Bombings, street clashes, militant organisations and industrial unrest are testing the institutions of the post-war state.

You will lead a political party through the Years of Lead. Every policy has consequences. Economic pressure, public support, public security and political stability will shape your future.

Choose your political organisation.

- @dc_start: Democrazia Cristiana (DC)
- @pci_start: Partito Comunista Italiano (PCI)
- @psi_start: Partito Socialista Italiano (PSI)
- @msi_start: Movimento Sociale Italiano (MSI)

@dc_start
title: Democrazia Cristiana
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Democrazia Cristiana (DC)'; Q.public_support = 55; Q.stability = 60;

You lead the Christian Democrats, the dominant force in Italy's post-war political system.

- @monthly_briefing: Continue

@pci_start
title: Partito Comunista Italiano
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Partito Comunista Italiano (PCI)'; Q.public_support = 45; Q.stability = 45;

You lead the Communist opposition, seeking greater influence amid social unrest and political polarisation.

- @monthly_briefing: Continue

@psi_start
title: Partito Socialista Italiano
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Partito Socialista Italiano (PSI)'; Q.public_support = 40; Q.stability = 50;

You lead the Socialists, balancing reform, coalition politics and pressure from the left.

- @monthly_briefing: Continue

@msi_start
title: Movimento Sociale Italiano
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Movimento Sociale Italiano (MSI)'; Q.public_support = 25; Q.stability = 35;

You lead the neo-fascist Italian Social Movement, operating on the margins of the parliamentary system.

- @monthly_briefing: Continue

@monthly_briefing
title: Government
new-page: true

ITALIAN REPUBLIC

Date: [+ month +] / [+ year +]

Governing party: [+ party_name +]

Public support: [+ public_support +] / 100

Economic pressure: [+ inflation +] / 100

Public security: [+ security +] / 100

Political stability: [+ stability +] / 100

- @advance_month: End the month

@advance_month
title: Next Month
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.month = Q.month + 1; if (Q.month > 12) { Q.month = 1; Q.year = Q.year + 1; } Q.inflation = Math.min(100, Q.inflation + 2); Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 1);

A new month begins. Economic and political pressures continue to test the Republic.

- @monthly_briefing: Continue governing
